{"data": [{"author_id": "1239341587555115014", "created_at": "2026-11-07T06:13:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118949900805353500"], "id": "2118949900805353500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 126, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新出生人口规模，掉的太快！\n\n2025年，我国新出生人口降至792万人，首破800万关口，较2016年峰值近乎腰斩。\n\n据多方预测，2026年新生儿数据可能继续下跌超5%，，跌破750万关口，尚未见底。 https://t.co/fdTChD1Vh1", "url": "https://x.com/Huluwa678/status/2118949900805353500"}, {"author_id": "2249249564", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:49:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119215688392786263"], "id": "2119215688392786263", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 496, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "出生人口 https://t.co/6V8Lk4UocQ", "url": "https://x.com/xczyuan/status/2119215688392786263"}, {"author_id": "1711265046935072768", "created_at": "2026-11-08T03:50:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119276229933302177"], "id": "2119276229933302177", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "1107 红叶简讯 末世乱象\n\n*民政部数据显示：2026年前三季度，全国结婚登记仅有464.8万对。人口学家预测，这意味着2027年的出生人口将暴跌。\n*11月6日，全国高校首个“冷门绝学学院”在中国社会科学院大学（社科大）正式揭牌成立。\n#民政部 #出生人口 #广电总局 #微短剧治理 #solana上海线下 #冷门绝学 https://t.co/AQTvtJa5q2", "url": "https://x.com/redleaffarm2026/status/2119276229933302177"}, {"author_id": "2080567325506588672", "created_at": "2026-11-08T05:46:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119305515268473198"], "id": "2119305515268473198", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "预测一下，中国大陆今年的出生人口！@grok", "url": "https://x.com/DaYeou10/status/2119305515268473198"}, {"author_id": "1857139445532618752", "created_at": "2026-11-07T02:12:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118889352004809200"], "id": "2118889352004809200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 315, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新出生人口掉的真快\n怎么都不生了 https://t.co/W1KiK67KYG", "url": "https://x.com/chensikey/status/2118889352004809200"}, {"author_id": "2377118497", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:19:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118845708052877547"], "id": "2118845708052877547", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 357, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "日本人终于肯生孩子啦！！！\n\n本质上是东京一个地方支撑了日本全国的人口出生率！！！\n\n日本厚生劳动省公布最新数据：\n\n2026年上半年，日本全国出生人口达到320458人，同比增长0.4%。\n\n这是日本11年来首次实现上半年出生人口同比增长！！！\n\n其中，东京出生人口41745人，同比增长4.7%，增加了1864人。 https://t.co/GO4OzJePZG", "url": "https://x.com/tokyo_feng/status/2118845708052877547"}, {"author_id": "1678568444890066944", "created_at": "2026-11-08T01:16:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119237708069433405"], "id": "2119237708069433405", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年结婚登记人数较2025年同期下降50.4万对;这样下去未来每年出生人口才多少啊 🫣 https://t.co/18NBbXJLEj", "url": "https://x.com/silence12351222/status/2119237708069433405"}, {"author_id": "54605379", "created_at": "2026-11-07T06:40:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118956782718701657"], "id": "2118956782718701657", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2050年只有300万左右的出生人口，好可怕，会一年死2000万吧。匪共能执政到那个时候吧，还有24年。", "url": "https://x.com/dancingfun/status/2118956782718701657"}, {"author_id": "420799590", "created_at": "2026-11-07T10:56:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119021182905471358"], "id": "2119021182905471358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "关于中国出生人口趋势，我最直白的总结就是：生一个，少一个。\n\n这是结构性出现严重的错误了。 https://t.co/pB3aVSSbGm", "url": "https://x.com/lituanpeng/status/2119021182905471358"}, {"author_id": "2108878139913056256", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:44:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118927446741516560"], "id": "2118927446741516560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年中国新出生人口降至792万人，首次跌破800万关口，较2016年峰值近乎腰斩，人口负增长已进入第四个年头。", "url": "https://x.com/Kylieee0425/status/2118927446741516560"}, {"author_id": "1987876394945384448", "created_at": "2026-11-08T13:38:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119424344258728094"], "id": "2119424344258728094", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok 中国每年出生人口700万，还在下降，按这样的速度快，20年后中国会是什么样子？经济发展，社会管制，社会福利？", "url": "https://x.com/Did9099/status/2119424344258728094"}, {"author_id": "1390858034", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:38:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118925953724547341"], "id": "2118925953724547341", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "新出生人口规模，掉的太快！\n据多方预测，2026年新生儿数据可能继续下跌超5%，，跌破750万关口，尚未见底。 ​\n各位蓝朋友，你们有几个小孩了 https://t.co/HrpuiQI0U7", "url": "https://x.com/whv2014/status/2118925953724547341"}, {"author_id": "1562136801183027200", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:10:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118919080006819878"], "id": "2118919080006819878", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 598, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我想了3天3夜也想不通\n\n一个国家，一个社会\n嫌出生人口太少，\n嫌大学生人口太多。\n\n到底是希望年轻人多生孩子，\n还是希望年轻人少读点书？\n😱😱😱", "url": "https://x.com/pnsin1/status/2118919080006819878"}, {"author_id": "2109544153512325120", "created_at": "2026-11-08T02:05:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119249837212520484"], "id": "2119249837212520484", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok 比较近现代中国政府和巴西政府对民众的杀人记录，要求是必须有可追溯的因果关系，能证明是政府的决策导致了治下民众死亡，且可以把未出生人口，即胎儿，计入在内", "url": "https://x.com/preciso1989/status/2119249837212520484"}, {"author_id": "1614847677048524800", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118925158736159109"], "id": "2118925158736159109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 349, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "最近观察一组数据：全球穆斯林每年出生人口为5000万。\n\n许多穆斯林国家虽已开始控制或反对童婚，但6至9岁结婚者仍大有人在。\n\n如视频中的女孩，约12岁即已怀孕。\n\n此生育率确实无法相比。 https://t.co/2Vovve70Qj", "url": "https://x.com/GuiGui0vo/status/2118925158736159109"}, {"author_id": "874575005551661056", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119173042018422808"], "id": "2119173042018422808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我忽然有兴趣坚持一下活过今年，看看明年的统计数据了，为什么我感觉今年出生人口能跌破700万？\n\n以他们把带着小孩送外卖当励志故事来讲的智商看，我觉得很有希望。别人怎么看这个新闻我不知道，反正我当恐怖故事看。", "url": "https://x.com/ts6_pa/status/2119173042018422808"}, {"author_id": "1848026473434697728", "created_at": "2026-11-08T16:56:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119474164537176413"], "id": "2119474164537176413", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 303, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "幼儿园在关。出生人口从一千七百万掉到九百多万，最先空出来的是小班。有的县城三年关掉一半民办园，改成了养老院。同一栋楼，楼下以前是滑梯，现在是轮椅坡道。人口结构的变化，不用看统计公报，看门口的招牌就行。", "url": "https://x.com/yuanyuansol/status/2119474164537176413"}, {"author_id": "1711306162552070144", "created_at": "2026-11-08T16:54:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119473638252630474"], "id": "2119473638252630474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 118, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "幼儿园在关。出生人口从一千七百万掉到九百多万，最先空出来的是小班。有的县城三年关掉一半民办园，改成了养老院。同一栋楼，楼下以前是滑梯，现在是轮椅坡道。人口结构的变化，不用看统计公报，看门口的招牌就行。", "url": "https://x.com/zhini1011/status/2119473638252630474"}, {"author_id": "1711265046935072768", "created_at": "2026-11-08T03:51:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119276667965428126"], "id": "2119276667965428126", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 148, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "1107 红叶简讯\n#民政部 #出生人口暴跌 #广电总局 #微短剧治理 #solana上海线下 #冷门绝学学院\n#阻止出境通知书 #吉林中行窦玉萍 #上海邮政马骏 #广西李标 #4名少将辞任人大\n#反跨境腐败法 #习近平 #6道主席令 #集体退居二线 #10年期国债收益率 https://t.co/MtoWoGeXRx", "url": "https://x.com/redleaffarm2026/status/2119276667965428126"}, {"author_id": "2093569579008348160", "created_at": "2026-11-07T03:27:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118908181728637405"], "id": "2118908181728637405", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 153, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "中国新出生人口规模掉得太快\n\n先看几组触目惊心的数据：2016到2025这9年间，新生人口减少994万，累计降幅55.7%；\n2025年同比再少162万，是近十年最大跌幅，此前龙宝宝带来的反弹只是短期假象。\n\n出生率从13.57‰跌到5.63‰，如今新生人口仅为1963年历史峰值的26.8%。", "url": "https://x.com/hani_ai666/status/2118908181728637405"}, {"author_id": "1444640763070005251", "created_at": "2026-11-08T19:14:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119508728785543590", "2119508984906567841", "2119509563057811537", "2119511073242169607", "2119512046970826805"], "id": "2119508984906567841", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小学、初中各种地理、历史的课本上都会说“我国是世界第一人口大国”，心里就一直都觉得，我好像只是正好中了“世界上最烂大街的出生选择”一样。", "url": "https://x.com/hq_chihiro/status/2119508984906567841"}, {"author_id": "1444640763070005251", "created_at": "2026-11-08T19:13:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119508728785543590", "2119508984906567841", "2119509563057811537", "2119511073242169607", "2119512046970826805"], "id": "2119508728785543590", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小学、初中各种地理、历史的课本上都会说“我国是世界第一人口大国”，心里就一直都觉得，我好像只是正好中了“世界上最烂大街的出生选择”一样。", "url": "https://x.com/hq_chihiro/status/2119508728785543590"}, {"author_id": "1444640763070005251", "created_at": "2026-11-08T19:17:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119508728785543590", "2119508984906567841", "2119509563057811537", "2119511073242169607", "2119512046970826805"], "id": "2119509563057811537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "小学、初中各种地理、历史的课本上都会说“我国是世界第一人口大国”，心里就一直都觉得，我好像只是正好中了“世界上最常见、最烂大街的出生选择”一样。", "url": "https://x.com/hq_chihiro/status/2119509563057811537"}, {"author_id": "1807801398270304256", "created_at": "2026-11-07T10:15:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119010722491617633"], "id": "2119010722491617633", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "现在经常刷到那些生了很多娃的短视频，平台应该是在助推。\n\n真的很讽刺。\n\n我们80后当年，有多少人是“跑计生”出来的。  \n躲到山林里出生的，交了多少罚款，还有那些事就不说了。\n\n如今出生人口暴跌，又开始想折腾我们了？\n\n政策一变，过去被罚的，现在被鼓励。  \n中间隔着的，是一整代人的经历。", "url": "https://x.com/Hhq1U3pqfq7357/status/2119010722491617633"}, {"author_id": "8149482", "created_at": "2026-11-08T06:26:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119315574379393346"], "id": "2119315574379393346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 47, "impression_count": 59279, "like_count": 250, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 53, "retweet_count": 31}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118455028738375887", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "【中国结婚登记再降，学者预警：明年出生人口恐大跌】 中国民政部刚刚公布的数据显示：2026年前三季度，中国全国结婚登记464.8万对，比上年同期减少50.4万对。  \n人口统计学家易富贤预测：由于今年的结婚数下降了10%，意味着明年的出生数将会下降，大概只有七百多万。 https://t.co/1XGScAeEF4 https://t.co/ECeGtJDY9b", "url": "https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2119315574379393346"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1239341587555115014", "name": "加密葫芦娃", "username": "Huluwa678"}, {"id": "2249249564", "name": "xiao Y", "username": "xczyuan"}, {"id": "1711265046935072768", "name": "红叶TV", "username": "redleaffarm2026"}, {"id": "2080567325506588672", "name": "沉醉不知归路", "username": "DaYeou10"}, {"id": "1857139445532618752", "name": "陈永福", "username": "chensikey"}, {"id": "2377118497", "name": "東京老馮", "username": "tokyo_feng"}, {"id": "1678568444890066944", "name": "元始YC", "username": "silence12351222"}, {"id": "54605379", "name": "yingrushi", "username": "dancingfun"}, {"id": "420799590", "name": "Jason Lee", "username": "lituanpeng"}, {"id": "2108878139913056256", "name": "Kylieee", "username": "Kylieee0425"}, {"id": "1987876394945384448", "name": "sun han", "username": "Did9099"}, {"id": "1390858034", "name": "韭菜要翻倍", "username": "whv2014"}, {"id": "1562136801183027200", "name": "SeNa", "username": "pnsin1"}, {"id": "2109544153512325120", "name": "共产主义是一种精神疾病", "username": "preciso1989"}, {"id": "1614847677048524800", "name": "龟龟（X最快的龟）", "username": "GuiGui0vo"}, {"id": "874575005551661056", "name": "派大星（诚信互关）", "username": "ts6_pa"}, {"id": "1848026473434697728", "name": "媛媛", "username": "yuanyuansol"}, {"id": "1711306162552070144", "name": "不吃月饼", "username": "zhini1011"}, {"id": "2093569579008348160", "name": "Hani｜AI 实践派", "username": "hani_ai666"}, {"id": "1444640763070005251", "name": "hqin", "username": "hq_chihiro"}, {"id": "1807801398270304256", "name": "叶老头不服老", "username": "Hhq1U3pqfq7357"}, {"id": "8149482", "name": "美国之音中文网", "username": "VOAChinese"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2119509563057811537", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxrqpzqwha5pll041w04rnwl8d", "oldest_id": "2118845708052877547", "result_count": 25}}
